{"affair_id": 174785, "questions": [{"n": 1, "span": {"doc": "question", "page": 1, "start": "Alla luce di queste considerazioni chiediamo al Consiglio di Stato", "end_page": 1, "end": "indicato nella LEPD?"}}], "question_style": "single", "answer_style": "per_question", "answers": [{"n": 1, "span": {"doc": "answer", "page": 1, "start": "Premettendo che l'istruzione dell'iniziativa popolare incombe", "end_page": 1, "end": "se\nnecessario lungo l'iter dell'iniziativa."}, "joint_with": []}], "submitter": {"name": "Angelica Lepori Sergi", "doc": "question", "page": 1, "quote": "Per MPS-POP-Indipendenti Angelica Lepori Sergi"}, "co_signatories": [{"name": "Arigoni Zürcher", "doc": "question", "page": 1, "quote": "Arigoni Zürcher - Pronzini"}, {"name": "Pronzini", "doc": "question", "page": 1, "quote": "Arigoni Zürcher - Pronzini"}], "recommendation": "not_applicable", "recommendation_quote": null, "reasoning": {"doc": "answer", "page": 1, "start": "Premettendo che l'istruzione dell'iniziativa popolare incombe", "end_page": 1, "end": "se\nnecessario lungo l'iter dell'iniziativa."}, "notes": "A3 tie-break: answer doc is a debate transcript. Answer/reasoning = Vitta's first intervention, which replies to the interpellation's question. His second remark on p.2 is a procedural suggestion (send the letter to deputies) replying to Pronzini's rejoinder, not to the question; extending the span would pull the member's own rejoinder into the executive's reply."}
{"affair_id": 332044, "questions": [{"n": 1, "span": {"doc": "question", "page": 1, "start": "1. Lorsqu’une allocation de formation est versée directement", "end_page": 1, "end": "l’enfant qui perçoit directement le montant ?"}}, {"n": 2, "span": {"doc": "question", "page": 1, "start": "2. Dans une telle situation, les allocations doivent-elles", "end_page": 1, "end": "dans celle de l’enfant majeur ou dans les deux ?"}}, {"n": 3, "span": {"doc": "question", "page": 1, "start": "3. Le fait que l’enfant majeur en formation ne vive plus", "end_page": 1, "end": "fiscal des allocations de formation ?"}}, {"n": 4, "span": {"doc": "question", "page": 2, "start": "4. Le fait que l’enfant majeur en formation soit marié", "end_page": 2, "end": "versées directement à ce dernier ?"}}, {"n": 5, "span": {"doc": "question", "page": 2, "start": "5. Le versement direct à l’enfant majeur en formation", "end_page": 2, "end": "vit plus au domicile familial ou est marié ?"}}, {"n": 6, "span": {"doc": "question", "page": 2, "start": "6. Existe-t-il des directives cantonales", "end_page": 2, "end": "concernant ces différentes situations ?"}}, {"n": 7, "span": {"doc": "question", "page": 2, "start": "7. Le Conseil d’Etat envisage-t-il de clarifier", "end_page": 2, "end": "formation à un enfant majeur ?"}}], "question_style": "enumerated", "answer_style": "per_question", "answers": [{"n": 1, "span": {"doc": "answer", "page": 3, "start": "Lorsque l’allocation de formation est allouée directement", "end_page": 3, "end": "le sujet fiscal est l’enfant majeur."}, "joint_with": []}, {"n": 2, "span": {"doc": "answer", "page": 3, "start": "Dans cette situation, les allocations doivent être déclarées", "end_page": 3, "end": "déclarées chez l’enfant majeur."}, "joint_with": []}, {"n": 3, "span": {"doc": "answer", "page": 3, "start": "Non. 4. Le fait que l’enfant", "end_page": 3, "end": "Non."}, "joint_with": []}, {"n": 4, "span": {"doc": "answer", "page": 3, "start": "Non. 5. Le versement direct", "end_page": 3, "end": "Non."}, "joint_with": []}, {"n": 5, "span": {"doc": "answer", "page": 3, "start": "Oui, les allocations de formation allouées et imposées", "end_page": 3, "end": "Demeurent réservées les conséquences sur le barème applicable."}, "joint_with": []}, {"n": 6, "span": {"doc": "answer", "page": 4, "start": "Il n’existe pas de directive cantonale", "end_page": 4, "end": "ou de pratique administrative particulière."}, "joint_with": []}, {"n": 7, "span": {"doc": "answer", "page": 4, "start": "A notre connaissance, cette thématique ne soulève pas", "end_page": 4, "end": "de compléter le guide de la déclaration concernant cette thématique."}, "joint_with": []}], "submitter": {"name": "Ana Roch", "doc": "question", "page": 1, "quote": "Signataire : Ana Roch"}, "co_signatories": [], "recommendation": "not_applicable", "recommendation_quote": null, "reasoning": {"doc": "answer", "page": 3, "start": "Lorsque l’allocation de formation est allouée directement", "end_page": 4, "end": "de compléter le guide de la déclaration concernant cette thématique."}, "notes": "A3 tie-break: answers 3 and 4 are each exactly 'Non.' and explicitly linked to the repeated questions, so per_question with spans = 'Non.' only (repeated question text excluded). 'Non.' occurs twice on p.3, so start quotes extend rightwards into the following question number to be unique; the span itself is just 'Non.' (end='Non.')."}
